# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug
target

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# Generated by cargo mutants
# Contains mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

# cargo-fuzz: corpus files and crashes are local artifacts, not committed.
# Targets and harnesses themselves ARE committed (under `fuzz/fuzz_targets/`).
**/fuzz/corpus/
**/fuzz/artifacts/
**/fuzz/coverage/

# Deployment secrets — APNs / FCM / VAPID / TLS keys.
infra/secrets/
infra/etc-lakko/lakko.env

# Local dev env — passwords / DSN / etc. Template lives in .env.example.
# Production uses systemd EnvironmentFile=/etc/lakko/lakko.env.
.env
**/.env
.env.cred

# Generated proptest regressions (deterministic, but local artifacts).
**/proptest-regressions/

# RustRover / IntelliJ
.idea/
# Shared Run Configurations: kept local, not committed.
# The default env-vars template lives in .env.example + CLAUDE.md "Local dev".
.run/

# macOS Finder metadata — never useful in git.
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store